<title>UK: World rubber consumption rose in October.</title>
<headline>World rubber consumption rose in October.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>World consumption of both natural and synthetic rubber rose in October 1996 according to latest statistics from the International Rubber Study Group.</p>
<p>    Data in thousand tonnes -- OCT'96    SEP'96    OCT'95</p>
<p> Natural production		 560	 560	 510</p>
<p> Natural consumption		560	 530	 520</p>
<p> Natural stocks		   1,730     1,730     1,660</p>
<p> Synthetic production	     810	 800	 760</p>
<p> Synthetic consumption	    820	 800	 780</p>
<p> Synthetic stocks		 2,480     2,490     2,380</p>
